    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535860/extras/c468330c6507fe7362bf7d4c315107ba.avif?t=1740839356\" width=616 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Home Again</strong> is a short interactive story game about healing that follows Jason and a stray cat. Discover their story through the eyes of a cat as they meet Melissa, who will change Jason's perspective on life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535860/extras/37b830e64c7974b5590a2bf456d1a42c.poster.avif?t=1740839356\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535860/extras/37b830e64c7974b5590a2bf456d1a42c.webm?t=1740839356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535860/extras/37b830e64c7974b5590a2bf456d1a42c.mp4?t=1740839356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Jason and Melissa's relationship through engaging gameplay\u2014from their first encounter to their path of healing. Guide Jason and the cat's actions with simple, fun gameplay mechanics such as swiping, selecting stickers, breaking glass by pushing over the counter, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535860/extras/d5a7e483570e0ada4a0eb8b70867ffcc.poster.avif?t=1740839356\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535860/extras/d5a7e483570e0ada4a0eb8b70867ffcc.webm?t=1740839356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535860/extras/d5a7e483570e0ada4a0eb8b70867ffcc.mp4?t=1740839356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Home Again features heartwarming soundtrack that captures emotions beyond words. We can't wait for you to experience it!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535860/extras/c468330c6507fe7362bf7d4c315107ba.avif?t=1740839356\" width=616 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Home Again</strong> is a short interactive story game about healing that follows Jason and a stray cat. Discover their story through the eyes of a cat as they meet Melissa, who will change Jason's perspective on life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535860/extras/37b830e64c7974b5590a2bf456d1a42c.poster.avif?t=1740839356\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535860/extras/37b830e64c7974b5590a2bf456d1a42c.webm?t=1740839356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535860/extras/37b830e64c7974b5590a2bf456d1a42c.mp4?t=1740839356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Jason and Melissa's relationship through engaging gameplay\u2014from their first encounter to their path of healing. Guide Jason and the cat's actions with simple, fun gameplay mechanics such as swiping, selecting stickers, breaking glass by pushing over the counter, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535860/extras/d5a7e483570e0ada4a0eb8b70867ffcc.poster.avif?t=1740839356\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535860/extras/d5a7e483570e0ada4a0eb8b70867ffcc.webm?t=1740839356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535860/extras/d5a7e483570e0ada4a0eb8b70867ffcc.mp4?t=1740839356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Home Again features heartwarming soundtrack that captures emotions beyond words. We can't wait for you to experience it!</p>",
    "short_description": "Home Again is an interactive story game about Jason, a man stuck in an endless loop of work who adopts a stray cat. Discover Jason's journey through the eyes of his little cat friend as they meet Melissa, a caring florist who will change the way Jason sees the life.",
